---
title: Hybrid Index Reload Cycle
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as HybridIndexManager (auto reload)
    participant Storage as RosterStoragePort
    participant FAISS as In-memory Index

    loop Every reload_interval seconds
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: maybe_reload()
        alt reload needed
            Scheduler->>Storage: load_roster_entries()
            Storage-->>Scheduler: entries with aggregate embeddings
            Scheduler->>Scheduler: rebuild_index(entries)
            Scheduler->>FAISS: replace vectors
        else skip
            Scheduler-->>Scheduler: no-op
        end
    end
